# LAB10a: e1m1's start, slop with the status bar and the gun, in the `bands` x-ray: each
# of the renderer's 8 threads' bands of rows in a colour ("Every core draws"), held, then
# mixed out to the picture over file seconds 3.4 to 4.0. Which thread takes which band is
# the scheduler's, so the colours' order changes from run to run; the pixels beneath do
# not.

map e1m1

duration 5.6
fps 60
size 1920x1080
threads 8

preset slop
hud on
gun on
cvar gamma 0.8

camera fixed 480,-352,110 0,90

xray bands
mix 0 1
mix 3.4 1
mix 4.0 0

sound off
events on
